Command-line tools

Install:
  Install missing command-line packages and isolated uv tools; prepare uv as needed.

Upgrade:
  Update installed command-line packages, uv and isolated uv tools.

Status:
  Group installed versions by purpose; APT candidates use the local index.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  GitHub CLI uses the official APT repository; existing source files are retained.
  uv selects or downloads Python for each tool.
  The Python module is not required.
